       \\\"volume\\\": 0.004,\\n          \\\"unit\\\": \\\"g\\\",\\n          \\\"gmo\\\": \\\"http://purl.jp/bio/10/gmo/GMO_001938\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": \"notes\", \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": \"Source: https://togomedium.org/medium/M2404\\nOriginal URL: https://www.atcc.org/~/media/2C30C1AACE174F1887DA712958A3D182.ashx\\n\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\", \"new\": \"Source: https://togomedium.org/medium/M2404\\nOriginal URL: https://www.atcc.org/~/media/2C30C1AACE174F1887DA712958A3D182.ashx\\n\\nSuperseded historical provenance (not a current formulation claim):\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\\n\\nFalse LB constituent expansion is withdrawn. Source-specific amounts and preparation boundaries supersede flattened concentrations. Existing chemical annotations and earlier history are preserved, not recertified; no organism-growth association is added.\\n\\nSource preparation context (main preparation): Add and mix all components except for OADC. Autoclave at 121\\u00baC, cool to room temperature and aseptically add OADC.\\n\\nSource preparation context (main preparation): *Note: Mycobactin J is stored dehydrated in 2 mg quantities unless otherwise specified. Rehydrate w/ 2mL ethanol or 1mL/mg. (Available from Allied Laboratories, Inc., 2520 Hunt St. Ames, IA 50010). This describes reagent reconstitution; ethanol retention in the finished medium and the final volume are not specified.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M2404\", \"snippet\": \"\\\"Add and mix all components except for OADC. Autoclave at 121\\u00baC, cool to room temperature and aseptically add OADC.\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": null, \"field\": \"solutions[1].notes\", \"old\": null, \"new\": \"Source amount: 100 ml; scope: main preparation input. Volume-only input/dose, not a final-volume marker; 100 ml = 0.1 L. Inline enrichment composition is separate from its dose and from finished-medium concentrations.\\n\\nSource preparation context (Dubos Oleic Albumin Complex (OADC)): OADC is available from BD (237510) or can be made following the formulation above.\", \"status\": \"evidence_only\", \"reference\": \"https://togomedium.org/sparqlist/api/gmdb_medium_by_gmid?gm_id=M2404\", \"snippet\": \"\\\"OADC is available from BD (237510) or can be made following the formulation above.\\\"\"}, {\"old_field\": \"notes\", \"field\": \"notes\", \"old\": \"Source: https://togomedium.org/medium/M2404\\nOriginal URL: https://www.atcc.org/~/media/2C30C1AACE174F1887DA712958A3D182.ashx\\n\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAccessed: 2026-03-28\\n\\nConstituent composition researched from product specification.\", \"new\": \"Source: https://togomedium.org/medium/M2404\\nOriginal URL: https://www.atcc.org/~/media/2C30C1AACE174F1887DA712958A3D182.ashx\\n\\nSuperseded historical provenance (not a current formulation claim):\\nCommercial Product: LB Medium (Luria-Bertani, Miller formulation)\\nSupplier: Multiple suppliers (Difco, Sigma, etc.)\\nCatalog: Multiple (L3522 Sigma, 244520 BD)\\nSource: https://www.laboratorynotes.com/preparation-of-luria-bertani-lb-miller-broth/\\nAcc